  <Subsection title="Name">
    <Paragraph>
      <Term type="command">migrate-database</Term>
      - Migrate data between databases.
    </Paragraph>
  </Subsection>

  <Subsection title="Description">
    <Paragraph>
      The <Term type="command">migrate-database</Term> command migrates data between databases.
      This subcommand is currently not useful as only one database implementation is now supported.
    </Paragraph>
